Changes made by KI Klub Werder e.V. (November 2026):

- Removed all services except Ollama and Open WebUI, and removed the desktop
  app, Boost, documentation, tests, demo scripts, the Windows installer,
  GPU variants and repository tooling.
- install.sh, harbor.sh: repository and release URLs point to this fork.
- profiles/default.env: default services are webui and ollama; the fixed
  Open WebUI secret is removed; image versions are pinned; log level INFO;
  interface name "KI-Box"; default models bge-m3 and gemma4:e4b-it-qat.
- services/compose.ollama.yml: Ollama port binds to 127.0.0.1 only.
- services/ollama/override.env: context length, parallelism and loaded
  models reduced for 16 GB RAM.
- services/webui/override.env: persisted generated secret, German locale,
  Ollama embeddings with bge-m3, admin chat access off, new users pending.
- README.md, README.en.md, NOTICE, llms.txt and CITATION.cff
  added or replaced.
